    "title": "Cody Rhodes Set For Exclusive Interview After Randy Orton Loss - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Thomas Lowson ,\n34 minutes ago\nCody Rhodes will be a part of WWE SmackDown this Friday to share his thoughts following his Sunday Night’s Main Event loss to Randy Orton.\nFrom WWE :\nCody Rhodes returns to SmackDown after losing a highly personal showdown against Randy Orton at Sunday Night’s Main Event.\nREAD MORE: Tiffany Stratton Gives Update After Injury Scare During Livestream\nREAD MORE: Scary Botch! Tiffany Stratton Nearly Breaks Her Neck At The WWE Performance Center (WATCH)\nDon’t miss an exclusive interview with The American Nightmare, Friday at 8 ET/7 CT on SmackDown on USA.\nRhodes came up short against Orton in a match that told the story of Cody becoming more unhinged and unraveling, as has been the case lately.\nRhodes is still reeling from the end of his third Undisputed WWE Title reign as he lost the gold in the summer to start Sami Zayn’s first reign.\nZayn would lose the title to Punk nine days later but regained the title last week, all while Rhodes remains away from the title picture.",
    "summary": "Cody Rhodes will be a part of WWE SmackDown this Friday to share his thoughts following his Sunday Night’s Main Event loss to Randy Orton. Cody Rhodes returns to SmackDown after losing a highly personal showdown against Randy Orton at Sunday Night’s Main Event. Tiffany Stratton Nearly Breaks Her Neck At The WWE Performance Center (WATCH) Don’t miss an exclusive interview with The American Nightmare, Friday at 8 ET/7 CT on SmackDown on USA. Rhodes came up short against Orton in a match that told the story of Cody becoming more unhinged and unraveling, as has been the case lately.",
